------------------
{ printWidth: 80 }
------------------
# In a block quote whose first marker is three columns further in

> a
> <div>

# Without the inner block quote's marker, after an outer one in another column

> > a
> >  </b>

# Without the list item's indentation, in the column of its text

> > - a
> >   </b>

# Without the indentation of a footnote definition

[^a]: b
    </b>

# After a tab

- a
  <div>

# In a task item, two columns further in than the `[ ]`

- [ ] a
  <div>

